{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"ef48e1594963d4ac825c9aa5b3f27820c3aa961a656b683f98e23c867ecab576","digest":{"component_or_area":"MCP server LLM gates and attested-source snapshot layer","key_entities":["REBAR_ROOT","MCP_CODE_DIR","REBAR_TRACKER_DIR","repo_snapshot.py","_resolved_root","/app","/var/gerrit/site/mcp-code","review_plan","verify_completion","review_code","reconcile","attach_commits",".git",".dockerignore","Dockerfile.mcp","docker-compose.yml"],"problem_keywords":["attested-source gates","git repository","ref resolution","mcp server","repo root","configuration"],"propositions":["Attested-source LLM gates (review_plan, verify_completion, review_code, reconcile) fail with 'cannot resolve ref' errors on the deployed MCP server because the container's /app has no git object database.","The snapshot layer's repo_root resolution defaults to the current working directory (.) instead of consulting the REBAR_ROOT environment variable configured at runtime, causing ref resolution to look in the wrong directory.","The MCP container image excludes .git via .dockerignore and copies source to /app as a plain source tree rather than a repository clone, leaving no object DB for snapshot operations to query.","Blobless code repository provisioning at /var/gerrit/site/mcp-code (via provision_code) succeeds and resolves refs correctly, but the snapshot layer bypasses it by using a hardcoded fallback to the cwd instead of reading REBAR_ROOT.","Local-source gate variants execute but produce unsigned verdicts that cannot satisfy plan-review attestation requirements for task/story/epic closure.","No deployment-time enforcement validates that the code repository root is provisioned and resolvable, so containers with failed code clones degrade silently to the same error state."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787861130343876001,"uuid":"04d02499-9e62-4caf-95da-c3dd72edf7fe"}